Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":22,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1392,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1861180,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1405909624,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":101,"Preview":{"Id":1861180,"PostDate":1405909695,"PostContent":"Haven't seen any recent threads here for next year other than the one for 2014-2016 so I figured...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401612892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77582,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95b393c30070aedad2dcface8cc2b72e","RawContent":"Haven&#039;t seen any recent threads here for next year other than the one for 2014-2016 so I figured I&#039;d start one for October 2015 since I know there&#039;s a quite a few of us on here. \n\n\nJust a place for questions, concerns, advise, etc! \nAdvice*","Attachments":[],"Id":1861180,"PostDate":1405909695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Haven't seen any recent threads here for next year other than the one for 2014-2016 so I figured I'd start one for October 2015 since I know there's a quite a few of us on here. <br><br>\nJust a place for questions, concerns, advise, etc! <br \/>Advice*\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401612892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.26.2.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77582,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1056462c8aab931ee882785f4ec61127","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! I am about to set my date, and I would really like to plan for October 2015.. my only concern is weather. I will be having the wedding in Jamaica, and apparently October is the month when Jamaica gets its most rain. I read a bunch of weather reports and they all say that in Jamaica it rains randomly for short periods of time in ANY month, so there is really no way to predict it and there is no point in worrying... I don&#039;t want to be paranoid about it, but it would SUCK to have a gorgeous beach wedding be ruined by rain.&amp;nbsp;October would just work wonderfully for me personally, and it&#039;s a huge plus that the price is more affordable (due to it being the rainy season).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone been to Jamaica in October, or Is anyone else doing Jamaica in Oct. 2015? Any thoughts on the weather? Maybe a morning wedding would be less likely to get rained out than an afternoon wedding? I appreciate any tips or advice! Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Amy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861299,"PostDate":1405956961,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! I am about to set my date, and I would really like to plan for October 2015.. my only concern is weather. I will be having the wedding in Jamaica, and apparently October is the month when Jamaica gets its most rain. I read a bunch of weather reports and they all say that in Jamaica it rains randomly for short periods of time in ANY month, so there is really no way to predict it and there is no point in worrying... I don't want to be paranoid about it, but it would SUCK to have a gorgeous beach wedding be ruined by rain.\u00a0October would just work wonderfully for me personally, and it's a huge plus that the price is more affordable (due to it being the rainy season).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone been to Jamaica in October, or Is anyone else doing Jamaica in Oct. 2015? Any thoughts on the weather? Maybe a morning wedding would be less likely to get rained out than an afternoon wedding? I appreciate any tips or advice! Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Amy<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyamarsh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.26.2.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403004886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278556.jpg?_r=1430169267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyknight11","Id":278556,"Name":"amyknight11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77582,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b81c3c6b44d9dc1cd5680fa0c21011b5","RawContent":"@[member=\"amyknight11\"] Well I&#039;ve never been to Jamaica but my fianc\u00e9e is from Jamaica and he says it only rains for a short period of time during the fall months. And I&#039;ve seen a ton of brides get married in October in the Caribbean so I&#039;m guessing they all didn&#039;t have rainy weddings :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1861330,"PostDate":1405966399,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278556\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278556-amyknight11\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">amyknight11<\/span><\/a> Well I've never been to Jamaica but my fianc\u00e9e is from Jamaica and he says it only rains for a short period of time during the fall months. And I've seen a ton of brides get married in October in the Caribbean so I'm guessing they all didn't have rainy weddings <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401612892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.73.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77582,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"395bcad3c5b408c6cc9b54985870ff96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"amyknight11\"].....I am getting married October 10, 2015 in Jamaica.....I visited Jamaica in October last year and we had great weather.   I think it just depends.   helenk is correct that it only rains for a short while when it does (I was in Jamaica in June 2014&amp;nbsp;also and it rained while I was there).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I wouldn&#039;t let the weather be the decision maker as to whether or not&amp;nbsp;to have your wedding in October.&amp;nbsp; It could rain in October if you had your wedding at home.&amp;nbsp; The resorts have backup locations in case of rain.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!!!&amp;nbsp; and happy planning!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861365,"PostDate":1405980388,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278556\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278556-amyknight11\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">amyknight11<\/span><\/a>.....I am getting married October 10, 2015 in Jamaica.....I visited Jamaica in October last year and we had great weather.\u00a0\u00a0 I think it just depends.\u00a0\u00a0 helenk is correct that it only rains for a short while when it does (I was in Jamaica in June 2014\u00a0also and it rained while I was there).\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wouldn't let the weather be the decision maker as to whether or not\u00a0to have your wedding in October.\u00a0 It could rain in October if you had your wedding at home.\u00a0 The resorts have backup locations in case of rain.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!!!\u00a0 and happy planning!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397052122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.65.235.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77582,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e9a2a00c7733fc90f6889db0e206831","RawContent":"@[member=\"helenk\"] and @[member=\"FutureMrsGlover\"] ,\n\n\nThanks for the advice!! That makes me feel better. Weather will always be unpredictable so I guess I shouldn&#039;t base my decision on it. Happy planning to both of you too!","Attachments":[],"Id":1861367,"PostDate":1405981186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277534\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277534-futuremrsglover\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGlover<\/span><\/a> ,<br><br>\nThanks for the advice!! That makes me feel better. Weather will always be unpredictable so I guess I shouldn't base my decision on it. Happy planning to both of you too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyamarsh@gmail.com","IpAddress